    "body": "Follow-ups from PR #833's delta review (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/833#pullrequestreview-5858830549):\n- **Harden the jaw check.** `SetPlate`'s jaw check (`mod_vise.rs:120`) skips a block whose `face_gap` is `None` before the edit (the stock was not in front of it). Probe: `SetStock` moves the stock 130 mm along X; then one plate edit (pitch X +10, pitch Y -2) puts the adjustable jaw 16 mm in. The edit is accepted with only the clash warning (the posting gate still checks the steel). Treat `None` before as \"clear\", and pin it.\n- **Pin the MCP field:** `mcp_plate` should assert the `warning` field `set_fixture_plate` returns.\n- **A future plate-edit UI** must route `SetPlate::warning()` through `with_warning`; there's no UI path yet.",
